message: >-
  If you use this database, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite
  the accompanying manuscript (citation to be added once the preprint is
  available).
type: dataset
title: CMV Antiviral Resistance Database
abstract: >-
  A curated, searchable database of cytomegalovirus (CMV) antiviral-resistance
  mutations, built from a systematic review of the published literature. It
  combines a random-effects meta-analysis of recombinant-phenotyping EC50 data
  with published patient reports, and assigns resistance levels for
  ganciclovir, cidofovir, foscarnet, letermovir and maribavir.
